## DH2 .gitignore
## 基于 github/gitignore Dotnet 模板;补充 DH2 私有约定。
## 最新上游:https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/Dotnet.gitignore

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 构建结果(Build results)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
x64/
x86/
[Ww][Ii][Nn]32/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]/
[Aa][Rr][Mm]64/
bld/
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# .NET Core
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/                    # M0 §9 运行输出目录(报告/截图/日志)

# ASP.NET Scaffolding
ScaffoldingReadMe.txt

# NuGet Packages
*.nupkg
# NuGet Symbol Packages
*.snupkg

# dotenv environment variables file
.env

# Others
~$*
*~
CodeCoverage/

# MSBuild Binary and Structured Log
*.binlog

# MSTest test Results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
[Bb]uild[Ll]og.*

# NUnit
*.VisualState.xml
TestResult.xml
nunit-*.xml

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE / 编辑器
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs

# Rider / ReSharper
_ReSharper*/
*.[Rr]e[Ss]harper
*.DotSettings.user

# Avalonia 临时(运行时生成)
.avalonia/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DH2 私有约定(03 §7 / 04 §6)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 真实配置(含账号/角色名)不入仓
configs/local/*.yaml
!configs/local/*.example.yaml

# 数据(SQLite 等)
data/*.db
data/*.db-shm
data/*.db-wal

# 真机验证产物
artifacts/m0-report/
artifacts/e2e-*/
artifacts/capture-*/
artifacts/logs/

# MockGame 临时目录(运行期生成,不入仓)
%TEMP%/dh2-mockgame/

# OS 临时
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store